D.111.0100. - The system shall support the ability to autogenerate codebook. The following are checked in codebook: 
    D.111.0100.1 - The following are checked for a field in codebook: 
        D.111.0100.1.1 - Variable name 
        D.111.0100.1.2 - Label 
        D.111.0100.1.3 - Type 
        D.111.0100.1.4 - Field note 
        D.111.0100.1.5 - Branching Logic
        D.111.0100.1.6 - Action tag
        D.111.0100.1.7 - Identifier
        D.111.0100.1.8 - Required
    D.111.0100.2 - The following subset of field types are verified 
        D.111.0100.2.1 - Textbox with email selected 
        D.111.0100.2.2 - Textbox with date format e.g. D-M-Y 
        D.111.0100.2.3 - Dropdown 
        D.111.0100.2.4 - Radio button 
        D.111.0100.2.5 - Checkbox 
        D.111.0100.2.6 - Calculated Field 
        D.111.0100.2.7 - Descriptive Text (with optional Image/Video/Audio/File Attachment)
D.111.0200. - The system shall support the ability to modify and delete fields, which will subsequently alter the codebook.